# Lacrosse

Lacrosse is another sport I play, and it hits a different kind of intensity compared to basketball. Faster pace, more gear, more strategy, and more physical.

---

## What I Enjoy
- The speed of the game  
- Stick skills and the satisfaction of clean catches  
- Team strategy and positioning  
- Conditioning that transfers to basketball  

---

## My Gear Setup
| Item | Brand | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Stick | STX | Good all-around feel |
| Gloves | Maverik | Flexible grip |
| Helmet | Cascade | Standard for most players |
| Cleats | Nike | Lateral support helps prevent sprains |

---

## Skills I’m Improving
- Faster change-of-direction  
- Cleaner passing under pressure  
- Shooting accuracy from mid-range  
- Better defensive footwork  

---

## Quote That Hits Home
> “Lacrosse is fast, furious, and completely unforgiving — you either keep up or get left behind.”

